      "createdAt": "2026-11-06T14:52:06.000Z",
      "createdAtEpoch": 1793976726,
      "replies": 2,
      "content": "https://imgcap.vercel.app/\r\n\r\n有些网站上传图片会限制大小，这个工具可以压缩图片到指定的大小，例如: 10mb -> 500kb\r\n\r\n这也是一个 npm 包可以集成到你的项目上传组件中,省去了让用户手动调整的麻烦：\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\nimport imgcap from 'imgcap'\r\n\r\n// Social media avatar (500KB limit)\r\nconst avatar = await imgcap(file, { targetSize: 500 * 1024 })\r\n\r\n// With format conversion\r\nconst webp = await imgcap(imageFile, {\r\n  targetSize: 300 * 1024,\r\n  outputType: 'image/webp'\r\n})\r\n```",
